## Folders
| Path | Use it for |
|---|---|
| `playbook/fixes.md` | Known fix for a symptom: one line under `## Fixes` |
| `tickets/log.md` | Filed client issues and how to file; one line per ticket (`{{TICKET_PREFIX}}` ids) |
| `clients/index.md` | Client name, account id, stage. Nothing else |
| `log/` | One entry per session (format in `log/README.md`) |

A fix that mentions a ticket id must have that ticket in `tickets/log.md` (lint plugin `cs_playbook`).
